  "description": "YITAMOTOR clear headlights for 2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche Silverado. The lights will meet all your requirements and surpass all your expectations in terms of quality, efficiency, and service. They will boost your driving experience and make you stand out.\nFitment\n2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500 | 2500 | 3500 | 1500HD | 2500HD\n2007 Chevy Silverado 1500 | 1500HD | 2500HD | 3500 Classic Body Pickup Only\n2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500 | 2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding)\nProfessional installation would be highly recommended\nFeatures\nVehicle compatibility: headlights assembly compatible with 2003-2006 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD / 2500 HD / 3500; 2003-2004 Chevy Silverado 2500; 2007 Chevy Silverado 1500/1500 HD/2500 HD/3500 Classic; 2003-2006 Chevy Avalanche 1500/2500 Pickup (Without Body Cladding); high beam bulb type: HB3/9005; low beam bulb type: HB4/9006; bulbs are not included\nWaterproof: fully sealed with solid silicon & designed with one-way vents to prevent moisture from being trapped inside the housing, no corrosion or moisture worries in sorts of weather conditions\nBrighter lighting: the metallic parabolic reflectors provide more light output to create a broader and smoother beam\nSafety reflector: the sided micro-prism reflector makes the oncoming cars or passerby quickly notice you at night, ensuring your driving safety and others'\nImpact resistance: the polycarbonate lens & tough housing are highly resistant to shock, vibration for any tough road; professional installation would be highly recommended",
